<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35827" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pē^tra</span></b> , ae, f.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Πέτρα</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>the name of several cities.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<i>A city in Arabia Petrœa</i>, now the
			ruins of <i>Wadi Musa</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 6, 28,
				32, § 144</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Jer.
				48, 28</span></i>.—Hence, </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Pē^traeus</span></b> , a,
				um, adj., <i>Petrean</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">balanus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					12, 21, 46, § 102</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hypericon,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					12, 25, 54, § 119</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>A city in Pieria</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 29,
			26</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>III.</b>
			<i>A city in Thrace</i>, <i><span class="en">Liv. 40,
			22</span></i>. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>A city in Umbria</i>, <i>called</i>
			Petra Pertusa, now <i>Il Furlo</i>, <i><span class="en">Aur.
					Vict. Epist. in Vespas.
			17</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>V.</b>
			<i>A hill near Dyrrachium</i>, <i><span class="en">Caes. B. C.
				3, 42</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
